Subject: [PATCH 01/39] Revert "qt: remove dysfunctional Wayland window"

This reverts commit 04d8fcb923dcab281755c1a8dd07b6c2e1fc2ea1.
---
 modules/gui/qt/Makefile.am                    |  6 +++++
 modules/gui/qt/components/controller.cpp      |  9 +++++++
 modules/gui/qt/components/controller.hpp      |  4 +++
